OL,3,GNEWSAArts centre plan for prison could
OL,4,Abe filed in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn architect shaping the plan to
OL,7,Ftransform the former Reading Gaol into
OL,8,Fan arts centre said a first planning
OL,9,Fapplication could be submitted next
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FThe Ziran Education Foundation,
OL,13,Festablished by Chinese businessman
OL,14,FChanning Bi, bought the site from the
OL,15,FMinistry of Justice (MoJ) for #7m in
OL,16,FJanuary 2024.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
