OL,3,GNEWSAArts centre plan for prison could
OL,4,Abe filed in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FLead architect for the project Grace
OL,7,FTian said its plan will be divided into
OL,8,Ftwo phases. The first would seek to
OL,9,Ftransform the prison and supporting
OL,10,Fbuildings and the second would seek to
OL,11,Fbuild a new hotel complex.
OL,13,FThe 19th Century prison has sat empty
OL,14,Fsince the MoJ shut it for the final
OL,15,Ftime in 2014.
